Package: dockwatch
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Watashik <https://github.com/Watashik>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyside6.qtcore, python3-pyside6.qtgui, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-pyside6.qtnetwork
Recommends: python3-pyside6.qtsvg, udisks2, pulseaudio-utils, network-manager, bluez, power-profiles-daemon
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Watashik/DockWatch
Description: live port map of your docking station and laptop
 Shows which connectors of the dock and the laptop are in use, what is
 plugged in, power and bandwidth, with tray icon, window and terminal views
 and plug/unplug notifications. ThinkPad style, works with any laptop.
